  "body_html": "<h1>Welfare-Maximizing Knapsack Mechanism</h1>\n<p>Welfare maximization over feasible binary allocations induces a monotone\nallocation rule. Paired with Myerson payments, the resulting single-parameter\nknapsack mechanism is DSIC.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, thm:auction_knapsack_welfare_mechanism] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
